# VFX-LIGHT Light Renderer (UE Niagara Light Renderer): Torch.dfx's Flame emitter has a Light row - up to 8 of its alive flame particles each cast a point light (colour = particle colour x alpha, radius = sprite size x 30, 10 cd inverse-square) into the scene's local-light path. Starter at night (sun and both fill lights at 0), the torch on the Cylinder pole, the Cube stretched into a wall 70 cm behind it; simulated 2 s and shot from the side; then the Light row is disabled in the .dfx editor (Flame.Render.1.Enabled 0, saved: the level effect restarts with it) and the same view is shot again. The scenario re-enables and saves the row at the end; it does NOT save the scene.
Дано run Scene "Open Scene Starter.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано set 13376537502658031226 DirectionLight.Intensity 0
Дано set 17693095525329290091 PointLight.Intensity 0
Дано set 17729774111420330691 PointLight.Intensity 0
# VFX.System takes the asset handle: HandleForGuid(5c1e7a93d40b4f28a6e2b17f09c3d854) = Torch.dfx
Дано set 1414213562373095048 VFX.System 241330729926691968
Дано run Entity "Cube"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 120,150,330
Дано --subject selection set Scale 4,3,0.2
Дано run Entity "Campfire"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 120,150,260
Когда run Action Simulate
Когда advance 1
Когда advance 1
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 120,190,-160
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.12,1
Тогда-вид 0_lit night scene: the torch flame on top of the pole, a warm orange light pool on the pole's top and on the wall behind it around the flame, falling off with distance; the ground near the pole lit warm too
Когда run Open "VFX/Torch.dfx"
Когда set Flame.Render.1.Enabled 0
Когда run Document "Save this document"
Когда run Document "Close Torch.dfx"
Когда advance 1
Когда advance 1
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 120,190,-160
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.12,1
Тогда-вид 1_off the same view: the flame still drawn on the pole, but the wall, the pole and the ground around it dark - no warm pool
Когда run Open "VFX/Torch.dfx"
Когда set Flame.Render.1.Enabled 1
Когда run Document "Save this document"
Когда run Document "Close Torch.dfx"
Когда run Action Stop
